# stark_ui options, shown in the single STARK menu: main/Kconfig.projbuild
# sources this file (ARCHITECTURE.md §9). ESP-IDF does not pick up a
# `Kconfig.stark` on its own, so the menu is assembled in one place.

config STARK_UI_TARGET_FPS
    int "UI frame cap (frames per second)"
    default 30
    help
        The UI task renders at most once per tick and, after a tick,
        sleeps on stark_event_wait() for the rest of the 1/FPS frame
        unless an event arrives first. ARCHITECTURE.md §9.
